# T06 takeoff timeline (DESIGN 16.2 format: "T keydown|keyup KEY" and "T expect FIELD OP VALUE", T in s).
# Parked for 1 s, a tap of A (0.2 s), then hands off: the autopilot rolls, rotates, climbs out and hands over.
# Run: jet.exe -test takeoff (uses this file), later (T08 -script): jet.exe -headless -start runway -script tests\t06\takeoff.scr -exitafter 40 -log
0.9 expect phase == READY
1.0 keydown A
1.2 keyup A
5.0 expect phase == ROLL
5.0 expect onground == 1
5.0 expect lat_m < 2
14.0 expect onground == 0
14.0 expect lat_m < 2
20.0 expect gear == 0
40.0 expect phase == DONE
40.0 expect agl_ft >= 1500
40.0 expect kt >= 300
40.0 expect alive == 1
40.0 expect pullup == 0
